  "an11.992-1151:1.25": "paṭinissaggāya ime ekādasadhammā bhāvetabbāti. ",
  "an11.992-1151:2.1": "idamavoca bhagavā. ",
  "an11.992-1151:2.2": "attamanā te bhikkhū bhagavato bhāsitaṃ abhinandunti. ",
  "an11.992-1151:2.3": "rāgādipeyyālo niṭṭhito. ",
  "an11.992-1151:3.1": "nava suttasahassāni ",
  "an11.992-1151:3.2": "bhīyo pañcasatāni ca, ",
